cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "The Bitcoin Whitepaper: which version is which, and how to check"
abstract: >-
  A provenance record of the versions of the Bitcoin whitepaper, with the tools to
  re-derive it. Establishes what is machine-checkable about each version — hashes, PDF
  structure, embedded fonts and text — grades the evidence behind each claim, and states
  plainly which versions are held, which are known only by hash, and which are lost.
  Experimental research, provided as is; findings are provisional.
type: software
authors:
